{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"庄重、清醒，又带一点悬而未决的期待：已经愿意认真靠近，但还没有到能够放心投入的程度。\",\"thread\":\"此刻还没有任何实际经历可以证明所期待的东西真的会给人什么，因此认真并不等于确信。重要性已经成立，信任却还没有根据；人只能一面承认自己确实有所期待，一面保留尚未交付出去的那部分自己。\",\"used\":\"无\",\"new\":[\"有一种值得认真对待的期待已经成立，但它还没有得到实际经验的证实。\",\"人在愿意靠近的同时仍保留着自己，因为此刻还没有足够理由完全相信。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "140cb3e4-503b-48e8-8e8b-54dbc8c383d5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215623103202Z", "elapsed_seconds": 63.187, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T21:57:26.299044+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e260741a292bc476b5889d45ea301fa7442561bfa2e290928f48c106f4fb81c1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\m